- Expert level: 3-4 weeks

**Q: Do I need to memorize keyboard shortcuts?**

A: No! But learn the ones you use daily:
- Code completion (Ctrl+Space)
- Go to definition (Ctrl+B)
- Run tests (Ctrl+Shift+F10)
- Commit (Ctrl+K)

**Q: Can I use PyCharm for web development?**

A: Yes! With:
- Flask: Community edition fine
- Django: Professional edition better
- FastAPI: Community edition fine

**Q: How to switch from another IDE?**

A:
